Are you ready to start an interesting adventure with the little ducks in the pool? Ducky Match is a happy paradise full of interaction and surprises, where you can play with cute ducks and have a good time! We combine little ducks with match-3 gameplay, challenging creative and interesting levels in a relaxed and pleasant pool setting. It is very suitable for casual match-3 lovers. There is no time pressure limit in our game, aiming to provide players with a casual and enjoyable matching experience!

Key Features：

Cute little ducks and a relaxed pool background. The rubber ducks produce a crisp sound with each click, and together with the clear sound of elimination, every match is filled with a strong sense of accomplishment;

Classic match-3 gameplay with challenging elements: Rescue the little ducks in a maze-like chessboard. You must overcome numerous difficulties and various obstacles to find and match little ducks of the same color;

No time limits or score pressures. Master the game at your own rhythm, and enjoy the fun of matching freely while challenging difficult levels.

Hundreds of challenging levels: Carefully designed level mechanisms, including obstacles such as pool chest, floating cushion, and locked pipe. You need to use your strategy and matching skills to break through the levels. The higher the level, the more difficult it is, and the more generous the rewards;

Colorful scenes to explore: From the beach party to the magical path, from the western duck to the racer duck, each scene has unique styles and interactive details. Unlock more scenes and discover more surprises.

